        &lt;template&gt;&lt;![CDATA[&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Non-Disclosure Agreement (NDA)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;This Non-Disclosure Agreement (the &amp;#34;Agreement&amp;#34;) is entered into as of Today by and between:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disclosing Party:&lt;/strong&gt; [Your Company Name], with its principal office located at [Address].&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Receiving Party:&lt;/strong&gt; ${visitor.full_name}, with contact information at [Visitor&amp;#39;s Address].&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;1. Purpose&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;The purpose of this Agreement is to protect the confidential information that may be disclosed to the Receiving Party during their visit to the premises of the Disclosing Party.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;2. Confidential Information&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&amp;#34;Confidential Information&amp;#34; includes, but is not limited to, proprietary data, trade secrets, business plans, customer information, and any other information disclosed orally or in writing to the Receiving Party.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;3. Obligations of the Receiving Party&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;The Receiving Party agrees to:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Keep all Confidential Information in strict confidence and not disclose it to any third party without prior written consent of the Disclosing Party.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Use the Confidential Information solely for the purpose of their visit and not for any other purpose.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Take all necessary precautions to protect the confidentiality of the information.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;4. Exclusions from Confidential Information&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;The obligations of confidentiality do not apply to information that:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Is or becomes publicly known through no breach of this Agreement by the Receiving Party.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Is already known to the Receiving Party prior to disclosure by the Disclosing Party.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Is disclosed by the Receiving Party with the written approval of the Disclosing Party.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;5. Term&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;This Agreement shall remain in effect for a period of Visit End from the date of signing or until the Confidential Information no longer qualifies as confidential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;6. Return or Destruction of Confidential Information&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Upon request by the Disclosing Party, the Receiving Party agrees to return or destroy all documents, records, or materials containing Confidential Information.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;7. Governing Law&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;This Agreement shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the state of [Your State/Region].&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="signature-section"&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;]]&gt;&lt;/template&gt;
        &lt;type&gt;NDA&lt;/type&gt;
    &lt;/x_aleen_snguardian_visitor_nda_email_templates&gt;
